# Unit20
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit20核心词汇

certify/ˈsɜːrtɪfaɪ/证明/This document certifies your qualification.
chamber/ˈtʃeɪmbər/房间；议院/The case was heard in the chamber of commerce.
chancellor/ˈtʃænsələr/校长；总理/The chancellor announced new policies.
chaos/ˈkeɪɑːs/混乱/The fire caused chaos in the building.
characterize/ˈkærəktəraɪz/以…为特征/The region is characterized by its mild climate.
charter/ˈtʃɑːrtər/宪章；包租/The company signed a charter for the flight.
chronic/ˈkrɑːnɪk/慢性的/He suffers from chronic back pain.
circulate/ˈsɜːrkjuleɪt/循环/Blood circulates through the body.
circumstance/ˈsɜːrkəmstæns/情况/Under the circumstances, we had no choice.
cite/saɪt/引用/She cited several studies in her paper.
civilian/səˈvɪliən/平民/The attack killed many civilians.
clarify/ˈklærɪfaɪ/澄清/Can you clarify your position on this issue?
classify/ˈklæsɪfaɪ/分类/Scientists classify animals into different groups.
clause/klɔːz/条款/Please check the contract clause carefully.
coalition/ˌkoʊəˈlɪʃn/联盟/The two parties formed a coalition government.
coexist/ˌkoʊɪɡˈzɪst/共存/Different cultures can coexist peacefully.
coincide/ˌkoʊɪnˈsaɪd/巧合/My vacation coincides with the holiday.
collapse/kəˈlæps/倒塌/The old bridge collapsed under the weight.
colleague/ˈkɑːliːɡ/同事/She gets along well with her colleagues.
colonial/kəˈloʊniəl/殖民的/The country has a colonial history.
combat/ˈkɑːmbæt/战斗/The soldiers were trained for combat.
combine/kəmˈbaɪn/结合/We should combine theory with practice.
commemorate/kəˈmeməreɪt/纪念/The event commemorates the end of the war.
commence/kəˈmens/开始/The ceremony will commence at 9 a.m.
commentary/ˈkɑːmenteri/评论/The commentator provided insightful commentary.
commission/kəˈmɪʃn/委员会/He was appointed to the planning commission.
commit/kəˈmɪt/犯；承诺/He committed himself to the project.
commodity/kəˈmɑːdəti/商品/Oil is a valuable commodity.
commune/ˈkɑːmjuːn/公社/The artist lived in a creative community.
compact/kəmˈpækt/紧凑的/This compact design saves space.
comparable/ˈkɑːmpərəbl/可比较的/The two products are comparable in quality.
compassion/kəmˈpæʃn/同情/She showed compassion for the victims.
compatible/kəmˈpætəbl/兼容的/These two devices are compatible.
compel/kəmˈpel/强迫/The evidence compelled him to change his mind.
compensate/ˈkɑːmpenseɪt/补偿/The company compensated the workers.
competent/ˈkɑːmpɪtənt/有能力的/She is a competent manager.
compile/kəmˈpaɪl/编纂/She compiled a list of references.
complement/ˈkɑːmplɪment/补充/The two approaches complement each other.
comply/kəmˈplaɪ/遵守/All companies must comply with the regulations.
compose/kəmˈpoʊz/组成/The team is composed of experts.
comprehensive/ˌkɑːmprɪˈhensɪv/全面的/We need a comprehensive review.
compromise/ˈkɑːmprəmaɪz/妥协/They reached a compromise.
compulsory/kəmˈpʌlsəri/强制的/English is a compulsory subject.
conceal/kənˈsiːl/隐藏/He tried to conceal his feelings.
conceive/kənˈsiːv/构想/She conceived a brilliant plan.
confer/kənˈfɜːr/授予；协商/The university conferred an honorary degree.
confine/kənˈfaɪn/限制/The discussion was confined to one topic.
confirm/kənˈfɜːrm/确认/Please confirm your reservation.
conform/kənˈfɔːrm/遵守/All products must conform to safety standards.
confront/kənˈfrʌnt/面对/He confronted his fears bravely.
